+ * the tablet then powers it, and the keyboard sends framed keyboard, consumer
+ * and touchpad reports plus a heartbeat every 100 ms. The tablet drives a
+ * transceiver enable line while it transmits.
+ *
+ * Written from the OnePlus downstream driver (oplus_bsp_pogo_keyboard).
+ */
